			"Message": "docs(Common): Advance Documentation/Rust submodule pointer\n\nUpdate the Documentation/Rust submodule to `15bcb636` to pull in the latest Rust documentation additions.\n\nThe single new commit in the submodule accompanies the expanded IPC channel definitions and Sky event surface added in recent Common crate changes.",
